<title>MOZAMBIQUE: Soccer-Maxaquene win Mozambique Cup.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Maxaquene win Mozambique Cup.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maxaquene of Maputo won the Mozambican club soccer cup on Sunday with a 2-1 victory (halftime 1-1) over Textil do Pungue.</p>
<p>Sengo of Textil scored first in the 10th minute but Helder of Maxaquene got the equaliser seven minutes later.</p>
<p>In the 65th minute Maxaquene captain Antoninho scored the winning goal before a crowd of 28,000.</p>
